hiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:p007","text":"其九月，秦復發兵，使五大夫王陵攻趙邯鄲。是時武安君病，不任行。四十九年正月，陵攻邯鄲，少利，秦益發兵佐陵。陵兵亡五校。武安君病愈，秦王欲使武安君代陵將。武安君言曰：「邯鄲實未易攻也。且諸侯救日至，彼諸侯怨秦之日久矣。今秦雖破長平軍，而秦卒死者過半，國內空。遠絕河山而爭人國都，趙應其內，諸侯攻其外，破秦軍必矣。不可。」秦王自命，不行；乃使應侯請之，武安君終辭不肯行，遂稱病。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m007-0010","start":10,"end":15,"surface":"五大夫王陵","kind":"person","person_id":"fas_3ef_vnq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m007-0022","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"武安君","kind":"person","person_id":"0xk_jpf_0xw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m007-0038","start":38,"end":39,"surface":"陵","kind":"person","person_id":"fas_3ef_vnq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m007-0051","start":51,"end":52,"surface":"陵","kind":"person","person_id":"fas_3ef_vnq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m007-0053","start":53,"end":54,"surface":"陵","kind":"person","person_id":"fas_3ef_vnq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m007-0059","start":59,"end":62,"surface":"武安君","kind":"person","person_id":"0xk_jpf_0xw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m007-0065","start":65,"end":67,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"935_1k9_x7t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m007-0069","start":69,"end":72,"surface":"武安君","kind":"person","person_id":"0xk_jpf_0xw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m007-0073","start":73,"end":74,"surface":"陵","kind":"person","person_id":"fas_3ef_vnq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m007-0076","start":76,"end":79,"surface":"武安君","kind":"person","person_id":"0xk_jpf_0xw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m007-0159","start":159,"end":161,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"935_1k9_x7t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m007-0169","start":169,"end":171,"surface":"應侯","kind":"person","person_id":"5av_w6l_zea","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m007-0174","start":174,"end":177,"surface":"武安君","kind":"person","person_id":"0xk_jpf_0xw","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang","book_id":"b-shiji-073","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-073-baiwang"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:p008","text":"秦王使王龁代陵將，八九月圍邯鄲，不能拔。楚使春申君及魏公子將兵數十萬攻秦軍，秦軍多失亡。武安君言曰：「秦不聽臣計，今如何矣！」秦王聞之，怒，彊起武安君，武安君遂稱病甐。應侯請之，不起。於是免武安君為士伍，遷之陰密。武安君病，未能行。居三月，諸侯攻秦軍急，秦軍數卻，使者日至。秦王乃使人遣白起，不得留咸陽中。武安君既行，出咸陽西門十里，至杜郵。秦昭王與應侯群臣議曰：「白起之遷，其意尚怏怏不服，有餘言。」秦王乃使使者賜之劍，自裁。武安君引劍將自剄，曰：「我何罪于天而至此哉？」良久，曰：「我固當死。長平之戰，趙卒降者數十萬人，我詐而盡阬之，是足以死。」遂自殺。武安君之死也，以秦昭王五十年十一月。死而非其罪，秦人憐之，鄉邑皆祭祀焉。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m008-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"935_1k9_x7t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m008-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"王龁","kind":"person","person_id":"0th_8iq_2q0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m008-0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"陵","kind":"person","person_id":"fas_3ef_vnq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m008-0022","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"春申君","kind":"person","person_id":"uum_4gg_y9d","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m008-0026","start":26,"end":29,"surface":"魏公子","kind":"person","person_id":"ic0_1fb_fg8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m008-0044","start":44,"end":47,"surface":"武安君","kind":"person","person_id":"0xk_jpf_0xw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073-baiwang:m008-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"935_1k9_x7t","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-073